graph TD
    subgraph Compute Layer
        B1[Stateless Broker 1]
        B2[Stateless Broker 2]
    end

    Producer --> B1
    Consumer --> B2
    B1 <-->|Segment 4| S1
    B2 <-->|Segment 4| S2

    subgraph Storage Layer (BookKeeper)
        S1[(Bookie 1)]
        S2[(Bookie 2)]
        S3[(Bookie 3)]
    end

    S1 -->|Cold Segments 1,2| TS[(Amazon S3 / GCS)]
    S2 -->|Cold Segments 1,2| TS
    S3 -->|Cold Segments 1,2| TS

    Consumer -.->|Requests Old Data| B2
    B2 -.->|Fetches via API| TS

    classDef stateless fill:#ccf,stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px;
    classDef storage fill:#ffc,stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px;
    classDef tiered fill:#cfc,stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px;
    class B1,B2 stateless;
    class S1,S2,S3 storage;
    class TS tiered;
